/* 월드 화면 — 현재 월드 카드(누르면 구역 목록) + 던전 버튼. 부품·색·글자는 Theme.uss 를 따른다. */

.world-card {
	flex-direction: row;
	align-items: center;
	flex-shrink: 0;
	margin-bottom: 20px;
	transition-property: scale;
	transition-duration: 0.06s;
}

.world-card:active {
	scale: 0.97 0.97;
}

.world-card__icon-frame {
	width: 220px;
	height: 220px;
	padding: 20px;
	background-image: url("../../Pixel/slot_gold.png");
	-unity-slice-left: 6;
	-unity-slice-right: 6;
	-unity-slice-top: 6;
	-unity-slice-bottom: 6;
	-unity-slice-scale: 4px;
}

.world-card__body {
	flex-grow: 1;
	margin-left: 30px;
}

.world-card__name {
	font-size: 60px;
	margin-bottom: 6px;
}

.world-card__location {
	font-size: 36px;
	color: var(--ink-sub);
	margin-bottom: 14px;
}

.world-card__gauge {
	margin-bottom: 10px;
}

.world-card__hint {
	font-size: 36px;
	color: var(--gold);
}

.world-section {
	flex-shrink: 0;
}

.world-dungeons {
	flex-direction: row;
	flex-wrap: wrap;
	justify-content: space-between;
}

.world-dungeon {
	width: 49%;
	margin-bottom: 16px;
	height: 132px;
	font-size: 48px;
}
